{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/8c5d1e1d3c234ab0561a2d6924acdce8.avif?t=1758147567\" width=838 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/565b141806f387194e145e3f6c9fe59b.poster.avif?t=1758147567\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/565b141806f387194e145e3f6c9fe59b.webm?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/565b141806f387194e145e3f6c9fe59b.mp4?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into a world full of third-person 3D platforming challenges. Run, jump, slide, and dash to collect all the glasses before time runs out. Test your speed, reflexes, and strategy. Improve your times, discover shortcuts, and become the fastest ice cube!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/e1c18fea16a72690037699bde4846479.avif?t=1758147567\" width=946 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/12b2dc0a186514cfeecc5000b95b2840.poster.avif?t=1758147567\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/12b2dc0a186514cfeecc5000b95b2840.webm?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/12b2dc0a186514cfeecc5000b95b2840.mp4?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your mission is to collect the 30 glasses scattered across each level before time runs out. Every second counts: you must jump with precision, slide at the right moment, and use your dash to reach the most difficult corners. With each attempt, you\u2019ll learn new shortcuts, refine your route, and discover that speed is the key to surpassing yourself. Will you be able to find the perfect path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/d7fcc8bbf07a4e0bf429cf63dd099dc2.avif?t=1758147567\" width=587 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.poster.avif?t=1758147567\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.webm?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.mp4?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The challenge is not just reaching the goal: as you progress, heat and obstacles will put your endurance to the test. One wrong step, a poorly timed jump\u2026 and you\u2019ll end up as a puddle. Every mistake means starting over, but also an opportunity to improve your strategy. Tension rises, pressure builds, and only the fastest will survive the ticking clock. Become the most agile ice cube and prove your cool under pressure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026190?t=1758147567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/4357b6dce1e50d528222ec4c46d767ea32566cdc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758147567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/0d6ae1ad90359923821ac5c13dfb7f8566f43a2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758147567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/0d6ae1ad90359923821ac5c13dfb7f8566f43a2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758147567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/8c5d1e1d3c234ab0561a2d6924acdce8.avif?t=1758147567\" width=838 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/565b141806f387194e145e3f6c9fe59b.poster.avif?t=1758147567\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/565b141806f387194e145e3f6c9fe59b.webm?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/565b141806f387194e145e3f6c9fe59b.mp4?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into a world full of third-person 3D platforming challenges. Run, jump, slide, and dash to collect all the glasses before time runs out. Test your speed, reflexes, and strategy. Improve your times, discover shortcuts, and become the fastest ice cube!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/e1c18fea16a72690037699bde4846479.avif?t=1758147567\" width=946 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/12b2dc0a186514cfeecc5000b95b2840.poster.avif?t=1758147567\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/12b2dc0a186514cfeecc5000b95b2840.webm?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/12b2dc0a186514cfeecc5000b95b2840.mp4?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your mission is to collect the 30 glasses scattered across each level before time runs out. Every second counts: you must jump with precision, slide at the right moment, and use your dash to reach the most difficult corners. With each attempt, you\u2019ll learn new shortcuts, refine your route, and discover that speed is the key to surpassing yourself. Will you be able to find the perfect path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/d7fcc8bbf07a4e0bf429cf63dd099dc2.avif?t=1758147567\" width=587 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.poster.avif?t=1758147567\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.webm?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026190/extras/2bb7fc697f0fa22ea5c68c3311668bcb.mp4?t=1758147567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The challenge is not just reaching the goal: as you progress, heat and obstacles will put your endurance to the test. One wrong step, a poorly timed jump\u2026 and you\u2019ll end up as a puddle. Every mistake means starting over, but also an opportunity to improve your strategy. Tension rises, pressure builds, and only the fastest will survive the ticking clock. Become the most agile ice cube and prove your cool under pressure!</p>","developers":["OneGuyProductions"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4014760","name":"ICE!"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea